# api_flip_pitch.expect — Tello-style flip gates (pitch axis: f, b)
# Tello 風宙返りの判定（4 方向）
#
# Chain: SDK mode → API takeoff → "up 60" to ~1.1 m (below the SILS ToF model's 1.4 m
# FLYING → FLIP → FLYING sequence replied with "ok" → autonomous landing.
# Metrics pin the physics per flip window (window starts 0.1 s before the command,
# so the "start altitude" of alt_drop_max / alt_rise_max is the pre-flip hover):
# the true body rate integrates to one full turn with the expected sign
# (FRD: right roll = +p, nose-down pitch = -q), the craft never goes far below the
# hover, the rise stays within the ceiling margin (plan §5.3: 20-30 cm expected),
# and the true tilt settles below 10 deg within 2.0 s of the window start (F3: within 1 s of completion; the window starts 0.1 s before the command and the maneuver takes ~0.7 s).
# 連鎖: SDK モード → API 離陸 → up 60 で約 1.1 m（SILS の ToF 模擬上限 1.4 m より下。実センサは
# 応答 "ok"）→ 自動着陸。宙返りごとの窓（指令の 0.1 s 前から）で物理を固定: 真値の機体角速度の
# 積分が符号どおり 1 回転（FRD: 右ロール = +p、機首下げ = −q）、ホバーから大きく落ちない、
# 上昇は天井余裕の範囲（計画 §5.3: 20〜30 cm 見込み）、真の傾きが窓開始から 2.0 s 以内に 10° 未満に整定（F3 の「完了後 1 s」を窓基準に換算）。
#
# Thresholds are first values from the planar model (plan §5.3) and are to be
# re-tuned against the SILS result and then hardware logs (Phase 4).
# しきい値は平面モデル（計画 §5.3）からの初期値。SILS の結果、次に実機ログで見直す（Phase 4）。
# XFAIL (2026-10-02, flip plant fit): the SILS plant now reproduces the hardware flip
# dynamics identified from the first real flip log (logs/flip_test1; SSOT plant_fit_flip_2026_10).
# On the not-yet-fixed flip logic this scenario is EXPECTED to fail the same way the
# hardware did (gyro overshoot ~1900 dps -> abort at ~78 deg -> stops near 205 deg -> falls).
# It is re-enabled (marker removed) in step 5 after the logic fix + retune.
# XFAIL（2026-10-02、宙返りのプラントフィット）: SILS プラントが最初の実機宙返りログ
# （logs/flip_test1、SSOT plant_fit_flip_2026_10）から同定した実機の宙返り動特性を再現するようになった。
# 未修正の宙返りロジックでは、実機と同じ失敗（ジャイロ ~1900 dps へ行き過ぎ → ~78° で打ち切り →
# ~205° で停止 → 墜落）をするのが期待どおり。ステップ 5 のロジック修正と再調整のあとで再有効化（マーカー削除）する。
xfail: SILS now reproduces the real flip failure: after the plant fit (control/models/stampfly_physical.yaml plant_fit_flip_2026_10, from logs/flip_test1) the unfixed flip logic overshoots to ~1900 dps, trips the 1800 dps gyro abort at ~78 deg and stops near 205 deg, then falls (docs/plans/flip-maneuver-plan.md §5.6). Re-enable after the step-5 logic fix + retune.
exit 0
log_contains any "cmd: command"
log_contains any "cmd: takeoff"
log_contains any "cmd: up 60"
log_contains any "cmd: flip f"
log_contains any "cmd: flip b"
log_contains any "Flip requested (direction=Forward)"
log_contains any "Flip requested (direction=Back)"
log_contains any "Flip complete → FLYING"
log_contains any "cmd: land"
log_contains any "Autonomous landing engaged"
log_absent  any "reply: error flip"
log_absent  any "error move timeout"
# The detector still reports the commanded rotation; the StateManager must ignore it
# while in FLIP and never disarm for it. / 検出器は回転を報告するが、StateManager が
# FLIP 中は無視し、DISARM しないこと。
log_contains any "Gyro anomaly ignored during FLIP"
log_absent  any "GYRO_ANOMALY → IDLE_GROUND"
# Touchdown itself trips the impact detector (as in api_flight), so the only
# allowed impact is the one after "land". / 着地自体が衝撃判定に掛かる（api_flight と
# 同じ）ので、許されるのは land の後の 1 回だけ。
order "cmd: land" "Impact detected"
order "cmd: takeoff" "cmd: up 60"
order "cmd: flip f" "cmd: flip b"
order "cmd: flip b" "cmd: land"
order "cmd: land" "Autonomous landing engaged"
# Hover near 1.1 m before the first flip (flip.min_height_m = 1.0, ToF model limit 1.4).
# 最初の宙返り前に約 1.1 m でホバー（実行条件 1.0 m、ToF 模擬上限 1.4 m）。
metric alt_mean > 1.00 in 21.5 22.9
metric alt_mean < 1.35 in 21.5 22.9
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 8.0 22.9
# flip f (t=23): one full forward (nose-down) pitch. / 前方（機首下げ）1 回転。
metric flip_pitch_deg < -330 in 22.9 25.5
metric flip_pitch_deg > -400 in 22.9 25.5
metric alt_drop_max   < 0.40 in 22.9 25.5
metric alt_rise_max   < 0.60 in 22.9 25.5
metric settle_time_s  < 2.00 in 22.9 25.5
# flip b (t=28, 5 s after flip f so the horizontal velocity has decayed below C4's 0.3 m/s): one full backward (nose-up) pitch. / 後方（機首上げ）1 回転。
metric flip_pitch_deg >  330 in 27.9 30.5
metric flip_pitch_deg <  400 in 27.9 30.5
metric alt_drop_max   < 0.40 in 27.9 30.5
metric alt_rise_max   < 0.60 in 27.9 30.5
metric settle_time_s  < 2.00 in 27.9 30.5
# Never near the ground across all four flips; level again before landing.
# 4 回を通して地面に近づかない。着陸前に水平に戻っている。
metric alt_min  > 0.60 in 22.9 31.0
metric tilt_max < 0.2618 in 30.5 31.0  # 15.0 deg
# Landed at the end. / 最後は接地。
metric alt_max < 0.10 in 38.0 39.5
